      "id": "Q9PR9achVS7aUDDt",
      "name": "Sour Bomb",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "Q9PR9achVS7aUDDt",
        "folder": "uPmhCeFVuSxdGyLL",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Sour Bomb",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can mix ingredients with a powerful sour smell into an alchemical bomb to make its explosion an overpowering stench. Any creature hit by the bomb must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class] save against your class DC in addition to the bomb's normal effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected beyond a strong craving for pickles.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fleeing] for 1 round from the smell.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
